# Agent-local docs
CLAUDE.md

# QuestaSim / ModelSim runtime artifacts
work/
*.ucdb
*.wlf
*.vcd
dump.vcd
transcript
transcript[0-9]*.txt
modelsim.ini
vsim.dbg
vsim.wlf
.qwave.db
# Exception: simulation evidence committed alongside code changes.
# Only PNG waveform renderings are tracked under waveforms/; the source
# .wlf / .vcd files and intermediate timing text are regenerable and live
# only on the farm or locally for inspection.
!docs/sim_evidence/*.ucdb
!docs/sim_evidence/transcript_*.txt
!docs/sim_evidence/waveforms/*.png

# Generated memory initialization files
# - Anchored at root in case someone runs the generator from the wrong cwd
# - sim/ is the canonical location (memfilegenerator.py writes there)
# - archive/**/*.mem stays tracked because it was committed historically
/*.mem
sim/*.mem

# Stimulus files copied into sim/ at simulation start (by run.do)
sim/busops.txt

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Presentation build artifacts
# - The Marp markdown source (docs/PRESENTATION.md) is the canonical file.
# - The exported PDF (docs/PRESENTATION.pdf) is tracked as a recruiter-
#   facing read-only artifact, but the PPTX is the local editable working
#   copy — regenerable via `npx @marp-team/marp-cli docs/PRESENTATION.md --pptx`.
docs/*.pptx
